<img
	src="/rapidccna/first-loop.webp"
	alt="Six RapidCCNA screens on a dark navy background: the dashboard, a binary and hex tutorial card, a subnetting question with its explanation, the Subnet Sprint drill, the Bit Flipper drill, and a session summary"
	width="1290"
